sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API
  participant O as Orders Lambda
  participant D as DynamoDB
  participant Q as SQS
  participant W as Worker
  C->>A: POST /orders
  A->>O: invoke
  O->>D: put order (status=PENDING)
  O->>Q: publish OrderCreated
  O-->>C: 202 Accepted + orderId
  Q->>W: OrderCreated
  W->>W: render PDF
  W->>D: update status=FULFILLED
  Note over O,Q: New in this PR: write happens before publish,<br/>so a failed publish never loses the order
